  "description": "Details of Condition 5-  Pre-work Survey Aand Scope of Work as required by planning permission 23/AP/1686 dated 26/09/2023 for he proposal is to carry out like-for like repairs to the masonry river wall of the building, concrete buttresses and the timber jetty. The repair types are listed below;\r- Replacement of missing bricks and mortar;\r- Repointing of mortar;\r- Brickwork recasement and repointing;\r- Injection grouting (concrete crack filling);\r- Concrete repairs (including replacement of some reinforcing bars);\r- Removing debris from inside of the flap valves;\r- Sealing interfaces between pipes and the masonry wall;\r- Cleaning/ greasing of the flap valves;\r- Replacement of waterproof rendering;\r- Removing loose steel plates from tie structures;\r- Replacing fixings on the timber jetty;\r-Replacing damaged or missing timber planks;\r-Replace a broken handrail rung.\rAll materials used will be approved before use so that the match the exisiting.",
